{"id":155,"slug":"largo","name":"朗戈","en":"Largo","aliases":["朗戈","largo"],"attr":"str","attrLabel":"力量","attack":"近战","roles":["辅助","耐久","控制"],"positions":[4,5],"positionLabels":["4 号位","5 号位"],"positionNames":["软辅 / 游走","硬辅 / 保人"],"lanes":["游走","优势路"],"complexity":2,"complexityLabel":"中等","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/largo.png","art":"assets/heroes/art/largo.jpg","card":"assets/heroes/cards/largo.png","winrate":47.83,"pickrate":1.7,"trend":[47.48,48.3,47.66,48.29,47.8,47.28,49.12],"delta":1.64,"pubPick":65284,"pubWin":31223,"proPick":12,"proWin":6,"proBan":35,"lore":"流亡的暗根族发现了一座活生生的大屿，泽鲁玛，它非常古老，只能用歌声交流。朗戈在学习与之交流的乐手团中长大，现在和一群青蛙弟子在各个大陆上漫游，打算把新旋律的灵感带回故乡。","hype":"凭借灵巧的手指和灵活的舌头，朗戈随时都能驱散敌友，用恰到好处的乐曲为他的团队提供伤害，治疗，或加速。","npe":"弹奏音乐增强友军，可以舔舐进行驱散","stats":{"health":648,"healthRegen":2.65,"mana":327,"manaRegen":1.05,"damage":"63–69","armor":4.3,"magicResistance":25,"moveSpeed":290,"attackRange":150,"attackRate":1.7,"turnRate":0.7,"sightDay":1800,"sightNight":800,"str":{"base":24,"gain":3.6},"agi":{"base":14,"gain":1.3},"int":{"base":21,"gain":2.6}},"abilities":[{"id":1659,"key":"largo_catchy_lick","name":"动人之舐","en":"Catchy Lick","desc":"朗戈用他的舌头舔舐目标单位，把它拉回一小段距离，施加弱驱散，如果是敌人还会造成伤害。\n\n击杀目标或驱散目标的效果后都会使朗戈暂时获得生命恢复。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散","lore":"在古老的岛屿泽鲁玛上生活了数个世代后，流亡暗根族的后代更具适应力，他们乐于尝试让他们祖先丧命的毒素。","notes":["可以舔舐神符，将其牵引。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"damage","label":"伤害","value":"85 / 170 / 255 / 340"},{"key":"pull_distance","label":"敌人拉回距离","value":"235 / 265 / 295 / 325"},{"key":"pull_distance_ally","label":"友军拉回距离","value":"375"},{"key":"dispel_hp_regen","label":"额外生命恢复","value":"4 / 7 / 10 / 13"},{"key":"buff_duration","label":"生命恢复持续时间","value":"8 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"13 / 11 / 9 / 7 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"80 / 85 / 90 / 95"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"700"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_catchy_lick.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1660,"key":"largo_frogstomp","name":"蛙力千钧","en":"Frogstomp","desc":"朗戈把小青蛙扔到一片区域。他们每1秒都会践踏地面，造成伤害和短暂眩晕并且区域内敌人的移动速度会被减缓。","lore":"乐手团的大多数用了数十年苦练音乐技艺，但就算是顶尖的朗戈也要承认，他的年轻弟子已经惊人地擅长数节拍了。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"damage_per_stomp","label":"每次践踏伤害","value":"36 / 48 / 60 / 72"},{"key":"total_ticks","label":"践踏次数","value":"4 / 5 / 6 / 7"},{"key":"slow","label":"减速","value":"12% / 18% / 24% / 30%"},{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"350"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"20 / 18 / 16 / 14 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"85 / 95 / 105 / 115"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"800"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_frogstomp.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1661,"key":"largo_croak_of_genius","name":"灵呱一闪","en":"Croak of Genius","desc":"朗戈对一名友方英雄弹奏一首小调。英雄的技能和物品拥有的魔法消耗降低，并且造成伤害后会回响，接下来5秒内再次造成原本伤害的一定百分比。\n\n只要作用下的英雄消耗了魔法，本增益的剩余持续时间都会减少0.5秒。朗戈身上的持续时间不会减少。","lore":"朗戈喜欢通过音乐的力量帮助他的朋友找到荣耀，从未错过任何一次上演精彩二重唱的机会。","notes":["只适用于可受到技能增强作用的伤害来源。","只会在来源和目标相距2000以内时施加伤害。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"damage_portion_pct","label":"伤害回响","value":"30% / 35% / 40% / 45%"},{"key":"mana_cost_reduction","label":"魔法消耗降低","value":"15%"},{"key":"duration","label":"加成持续时间","value":"15 / 20 / 25 / 30 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"25 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"40"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"800"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_croak_of_genius.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1663,"key":"largo_song_fight_song","name":"巨腹闪电战","en":"Bullbelly Blitz","desc":"朗戈弹奏的乐曲对附近敌人造成20 / 30 / 40点魔法伤害。乐曲还会使附近友方英雄的技能增强提升，并且他们的攻击造成额外魔法伤害。","lore":"“嘿，沙滩上突然有人打架的时候，你要学会用上你的音乐实力，不然派对很快就结束咯。”","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"这首乐曲用于两首共弹时每层律动都会额外造成0点魔法伤害。","values":[{"key":"burst_damage","label":"伤害","value":"20 / 30 / 40"},{"key":"damage_per_stack","label":"每层叠加伤害","value":"0","scepter":"6 / 10 / 14"},{"key":"magic_damage_bonus","label":"额外魔法伤害","value":"20% / 25% / 30%"},{"key":"spell_amp_bonus","label":"技能增强","value":"8% / 12% / 16%"},{"key":"battle_burst_duration","label":"加成持续时间","value":"1 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"0.2 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"25 / 35 / 45"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_song_fight_song.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true},{"id":1664,"key":"largo_song_double_time","name":"疾步生风","en":"Hotfeet Hustle","desc":"朗戈弹奏的乐曲会提升附近友方单位的移动速度，还有短时间的减速抗性。","lore":"“这就像那个沼泽女巫的吓人老故事。要是跳的时候想再快点，最好看清楚往哪跳。”","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"movespeed_bonus_burst","label":"移动速度","value":"16% / 20% / 24%"},{"key":"slow_resistance","label":"减速抗性","value":"70% / 75% / 80%"},{"key":"movement_burst_duration","label":"加速持续时间","value":"1 秒"},{"key":"slow_resistance_burst_duration","label":"减速抗性持续时间","value":"0.3 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"0.2 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"25 / 35 / 45"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_song_double_time.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1665,"key":"largo_song_good_vibrations","name":"大屿灵药","en":"Island Elixir","desc":"朗戈弹奏的乐曲会治疗附近友方英雄。","lore":"“假如这首歌能治愈永恒的孤岛，它就能处理你身上的擦伤和瘀青。”","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"heal_burst","label":"治疗","value":"30 / 55 / 80"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"0.2 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"25 / 35 / 45"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_song_good_vibrations.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1666,"key":"largo_encore","name":"安可","en":"Encore","desc":"朗戈对自身或队友施加的增益效果会延长持续时间。","lore":"","notes":[],"shard":"只要朗戈对友方英雄施加单位目标技能的增益效果，他也会获得该增益。\n\n只要朗戈对自身施加，该增益也会施加给指向性技能的施法距离内最近的友方英雄。","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"buff_amplification","label":"额外持续时间","value":"15%"}],"chips":[],"type":"innate","typeLabel":"先天技能","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_encore.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":true,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1662,"key":"largo_amphibian_rhapsody","name":"两栖狂想曲","en":"Amphibian Rhapsody","desc":"朗戈准备好弹奏乐曲。他被缴械，而他的技能栏切换为3个乐曲技能，每个都有不同的效果。乐曲只有弹在节拍上才会生效。\n\n每次成功弹奏他都会获得一层律动的叠加效果。每层叠加效果都会对他提供额外护甲，并且降低每首乐曲的魔法消耗，但是他只要错过一次节拍就会失去一层叠加效果。叠加效果在朗戈的乐曲结束后还会粘滞一小段时间。","lore":"乐手团的第一人弹了一首歌，召唤出一座有生命的岛屿，在海水的侵袭下即将灭亡的流亡暗根族因此得救。","notes":["这个模式下可以使用物品。"],"shard":"","scepter":"朗戈在每次节拍时可以弹奏两首乐曲。","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"范围","value":"800"},{"key":"rhythm_interval","label":"节拍间隔","value":"1"},{"key":"max_stacks","label":"最大叠加层数","value":"5"},{"key":"armor_per_stack","label":"每层叠加护甲","value":"2 / 3 / 4"},{"key":"song_cost_reduction_per_stack_tooltip","label":"每层叠加乐曲魔耗降低","value":"1% / 1.5% / 2%"},{"key":"stack_duration","label":"叠加效果粘滞时间","value":"5 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"2 秒"}],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/largo_amphibian_rhapsody.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_1","name":"+15 蛙力千钧伤害","en":"+15 Frogstomp Damage"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_2","name":"2.5倍 动人之舐生命恢复","en":"2.5x Catchy Lick Health Regen"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_3","name":"1% 灵呱一闪每秒最大生命值伤害","en":"1% Croak of Genius Max Health DPS"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_4","name":"+100 动人之舐施法距离 / +50 拉回距离","en":"+100 Catchy Lick Cast Range / +50 Pull Distance"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_8","name":"2 动人之舐能量点数","en":"2 Catchy Lick Charges"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_6","name":"50% 律动护甲光环","en":"50% Groovin' Armor Aura"}]},{"level":25,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_7","name":"+30% 两栖狂想曲乐曲效果","en":"+30% Amphibian Rhapsody Song Effects"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_largo_5","name":"2倍 蛙力千钧践踏次数/频率","en":"2x Frogstomp Stomps/Interval"}]}],"build":{"start_game_items":[{"slug":"branches","name":"铁树枝干","img":"assets/items/branches.png","cost":55,"count":187,"heat":100},{"slug":"gauntlets","name":"力量手套","img":"assets/items/gauntlets.png","cost":140,"count":149,"heat":79.68},{"slug":"tango","name":"树之祭祀","img":"a